# Vercel serves only what the Plan Builder needs: app/, engine/ (no fixtures), model/, the disclaimers and the license.
# Everything else in this repository (the coach's sources, research, tests, samples) stays on GitHub only.
/*
!/index.html
!/app
!/engine
!/model
!/DISCLAIMER.md
!/DISCLAIMER.es.md
!/LICENSE
!/vercel.json
/app/screenshots
/app/README.md
/engine/fixtures
/engine/*.md
/model/*.md
/model/COMPILE_REPORT.json
